Project Description
------------------
`sat-helix-ide` (also referred to as `sat-hx-ide`) is a Zellij session composer
for a Helix-centered workflow, enhanced with multiple additional tools including
Yazi, Lazygit/GitUI, revdiff, and glab-tui.

