### External Tools
This project is designed to work with the following external tools, which are
not bundled but required for full functionality:

- **Zellij** (https://zellij.dev/) - Terminal workspace multiplexer
- **Helix** (https://helix-editor.com/) - Modal text editor
- **Yazi** (https://yazi-rs.github.io/) - File manager
- **Lazygit** (https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit) or **GitUI** (https://github.com/gitui-org/gitui) - Git TUI clients
- **revdiff** (https://github.com/umputun/revdiff) - Review tool
- **glab-tui** (https://github.com/rcieri/glab-tui) - GitLab workflow TUI

Each of these tools maintains its own licensing and copyright notices.

